//! reasoning-templates.rs — twin of skills/system/_helpers/reasoning-templates.mjs (no-db helper
//! module). NAMES ARE CONTRACT: `fill` (fixture-tested) · `rng` · `makePicker` (both TRANSITIVE —
//! the JS returns a closure/PRNG generator, not a JSON value; ported as real code and proven by
